# MaCSad gateway routing policy

Import GatewayReadPolicy from "./gateway_read_policy.lg".
Import SchemaProbePolicy from "./schema_probe_policy.lg".

This facade gives the transport stable names for pure read-route and dependency
policy. The HTTP adapter still exposes only health; readiness is not wired until
the PostgreSQL adapter can supply the typed probe values.

## To isHealthRoute (method: Text, path: Text) -> Bool:
    Return classifiedHealthRead(method, path).

## To isReadinessRoute (method: Text, path: Text) -> Bool:
    Return classifiedReadinessRead(method, path).

## To mutationRouteAvailable (routeKnown: Bool) -> Bool:
    Return classifiedMutationRouteAvailable(routeKnown).

## To readinessProbeAccepted (rowCount: Int, columnCount: Int, schemaVersion: Int, serverVersionNum: Int) -> Bool:
    Return schemaProbeAccepted(rowCount, columnCount, schemaVersion, serverVersionNum).
